                        "🔄 Flat / Apartment (Resale)",
                        "🔑 Flat / Apartment (For Rent)",
                        "🏰 Gated Villa (New / Builder)",
                        "🔄 Gated Villa (Resale)",
                        "🔑 Gated Villa (For Rent)",
                        "🏡 Independent House (Resale)",
                        "🔑 Independent House (For Rent)",
                        "🏢 Commercial Space (New / Builder)",
                        "🔄 Commercial Space (Resale)",
